  m_Name: Companion Forest Dialogue 17
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Lines:
  - charName: Reina
    line: Whew, I'm beat. I didn't think we'd have to fight this many slimes.
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: Hopefully we can finish this assignment for the Chief and make him proud.
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: Say, it's been a while since the two of us sat together like this.
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: Remember when we'd sneak out of the village just to explore the woods?
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: We'd always get in trouble when we came back.
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: ...I guess not much has changed, huh? You're still just as quiet as ever.
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: '*giggle*'
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Ely
    line: ...
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
  - charName: Reina
    line: Anyway, I'm really glad we're doing this together. It's nice having you
      by my side again.
    reaction: 
    choices: []
    redirectDialogueIndex: -1
